      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; home around 16:15; at the Grey Heron from about 18:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 10 back at the mill from about 07:30; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; home around 16:15; back at the Grey Heron from about 17:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
