      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0001",
      "key": "K0002",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 16:00 I was at the mill; around 16:07 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:13 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:09 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:14 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:14 I passed through the square; around 07:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:30 to 16:15 I was at the mill; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 16:10 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:16 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:16 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:16 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0003",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Nora told me there's bad blood between them and Ruth \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:nora",
       "person:ruth",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "marta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0004",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Bruno told me there's bad blood between them and Marta \u2014 a dog that was never returned.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:bruno",
       "person:marta",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
