      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Grey Heron, from about 18:00 to 22:00 on Day 10, I saw Bruno, Clara, Daniel, Emil, Marta, Nora, Ruth and Viktor, coming and going; Daniel was the worse for drink.",
      "time": 14039,
      "topics": [
       "window"
      ]
