      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9, from about 09:00 I was at the grocery; home around 09:30; at the Grey Heron from about 11:30; home around 23:15 and to bed; on Day 10 at the Dunmore house from about 10:30; back at the Grey Heron from about 11:15; home around 23:30 and to bed.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
