      "in": "K0060",
      "key": "K0061",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:17 I passed through the square; around 09:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:30 to 11:15 I was at home; around 11:18 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:24 I passed through the square; from about 11:30 to 23:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 23:08 I passed through the square; around 23:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 10:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 10:15 I passed through Mill Road; around 10:21 I passed through the square; from about 10:30 to 11:15 I was at the Dunmore house; around 11:09 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 23:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 23:16 I passed through the square; around 23:22 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "marta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0062",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Marta and I have never got on \u2014 a dog that was never returned.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:marta"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "ida"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0063",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I owe Ida 46 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:ida"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0064",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Viktor told me Nora owes them 35 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:nora",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0065",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Ida told me there's bad blood between Anton and Viktor \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0066",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Nora told me there's bad blood between them and Ruth \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:nora",
       "person:ruth",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "nora"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0067",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Nora owes me 76 crowns.",
      "time": 6714,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:nora"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0068",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Viktor told me Nora paid them back 35 crowns around 17:00 on Day 5.",
      "time": 6774,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:nora",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "daniel"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0109",
      "key": "K0069",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I turned Daniel down when they asked me for a loan, around 21:00 on Day 6.",
      "time": 8454,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "daniel"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0109",
      "key": "K0070",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Daniel came asking me for money, around 21:00 on Day 6. Times are hard for them.",
      "time": 8454,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0071",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Viktor told me someone refused Nora a loan around 13:45 on Day 7.",
      "time": 9470,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:nora",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "daniel",
       "nora"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0072",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Viktor told me Daniel refused Nora a loan around 12:45 on Day 7.",
      "time": 9410,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel",
       "person:nora",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "daniel",
       "nora"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0110",
      "key": "K0073",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Nora told me they have been taking food on credit from Daniel (40 crowns owed).",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel",
       "person:nora",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "daniel",
       "marta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0110",
      "key": "K0074",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Viktor told me Marta has been taking food on credit from Daniel (24 crowns owed).",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel",
       "person:marta",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0075",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Viktor told me Nora has been short of money \u2014 asking around for money.",
      "time": 9410,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:nora",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
