      "in": "K0114",
      "key": "K0115",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 17:00 I was at the workshop; around 17:07 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:12 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:03 I passed through the square; from about 22:00 to 08:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:06 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 17:15 I was at the workshop; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 17:17 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:00 I was at home; around 18:05 I passed through the square; from about 18:00 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:04 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
