      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9, from about 09:00 I was at the grocery; home around 18:15; at the Grey Heron from about 19:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 10 back at the grocery from about 08:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; home around 18:30; back at the Grey Heron from about 19:15; home around 22:30 and to bed.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
