      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0163",
      "key": "K0164",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:08 I passed through the square; around 18:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:17 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:19 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:04 I passed through the square; around 22:10 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:13 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:19 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 18:17 I passed through the square; around 18:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:30 to 19:00 I was at home; around 19:05 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:11 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:17 I passed through the square; around 22:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "marta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0165",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Bruno told me there's bad blood between them and Marta \u2014 a dog that was never returned.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:bruno",
       "person:marta",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "ida"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0166",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Ida told me Bruno owes them 46 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:bruno",
       "person:ida",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0167",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Marta told me there's bad blood between Anton and Viktor \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0168",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Viktor told me there's bad blood between Nora and Ruth \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
