      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0224",
      "key": "K0225",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 16:00 I was at the mill; around 16:07 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:13 I passed through the square; from about 16:15 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:11 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:08 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:18 I passed through the square; around 07:24 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:30 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:15 I passed through Mill Road; around 16:21 I passed through the square; from about 16:30 to 21:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 21:16 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "marta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0226",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Bruno told me there's bad blood between them and Marta \u2014 a dog that was never returned.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
