      "key": "K0279",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 09:00 I was at the grocery; around 09:07 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:00 I was at the clinic; around 17:06 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 20:00 I was at home; around 20:05 I passed through the square; from about 20:00 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:07 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:18 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the clinic; around 17:15 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:18 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:09 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
