      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0334",
      "key": "K0335",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 09:15 I was at home; around 09:10 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:14 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 19:00 I was at home; around 19:07 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:10 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:15 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:00 I was at the grocery; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 17:05 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:17 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:00 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:02 I passed through the square; from about 22:00 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "marta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0336",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "Bruno and I have never got on \u2014 a dog that was never returned.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:bruno"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "anton",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0337",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me there's bad blood between them and Viktor \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:anton",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "ida"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": true,
      "key": "K0338",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Daniel told me Bruno owes Ida 46 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:bruno",
       "person:ida",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0339",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Clara told me there's bad blood between Nora and Ruth \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "conflicts",
       "person:nora",
       "person:ruth",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": true,
      "key": "K0340",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Bruno told me Nora owes Viktor 35 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:nora",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0341",
      "place": null,
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "I saw someone turn someone down for a loan around 21:00 on Day 6.",
      "time": 8454,
      "topics": [
       "money"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "bruno",
       "nora"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0342",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Bruno told me Nora owes them 76 crowns.",
      "time": 6714,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:bruno",
       "person:nora",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "nora",
       "viktor"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0343",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me Nora paid Viktor back 35 crowns around 17:00 on Day 5.",
      "time": 6774,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:nora",
       "person:viktor",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "daniel",
       "marta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0344",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I've been taking food on credit from Daniel; I owe 24 crowns.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "daniel",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0345",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Daniel told me they couldn't pay the rent to Ruth.",
      "time": 10620,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel",
       "person:ruth",
       "rumors"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "daniel",
       "nora"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0346",
      "place": null,
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "I know Nora has been taking food on credit from Daniel (40 crowns owed).",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
       "money",
       "person:daniel",
       "person:nora"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "emil",
       "ruth"
      ],
      "era": "earlier",
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0347",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Anton told me Emil couldn't pay the rent to Ruth.",
      "time": 10560,
      "topics": [
