      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9, from about 09:00 I was at the mill; home around 16:15; at the Grey Heron from about 20:15; home around 22:15 and to bed; on Day 10 back at the mill from about 07:30; home around 16:15; back at the Grey Heron from about 18:15; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
