      "in": "K0441",
      "key": "K0442",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 9: from about 09:00 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:09 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 20:00 I was at home; around 20:06 I passed through Mill Road; around 20:08 I passed through the square; from about 20:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:09 I passed through the square; around 22:11 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:30 to 16:15 I was at the mill; around 16:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 18:15 I was at home; around 18:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 18:18 I passed through the square; from about 18:15 to 22:15 I was at the Grey Heron; around 22:11 I passed through the square; around 22:13 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 12060,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
